Error [E0940]: `#Memo` cannot cache a lazy `Iter` result
  --> tests/ui/memo_lazy_iter_e0940.jet:2:1
    |
 2 | #Memo fn lazy_result() =[]=> Iter<Int> :: [1, 2].lazy()
    | ^^^^^
 Why: a lazy iterator carries live computation state instead of one completed result
 Fix: materialize the iterator before returning from the memoized function
